<title>ITALY: Italian shares fail to open, stay closed all day.</title>
<headline>Italian shares fail to open, stay closed all day.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian stock exchange failed to open on Monday due to a serious breakdown of its hardware and software systems.</p>
<p>This was the first time trading was closed for a whole day since the Milan share market's move towards screen trading in 1991-94, dealers said.</p>
</text>
